# {{context|psychology}} The [[childlike]] aspect of a person's [[psyche]] — typically, the personality and the memories of one's childhood — especially in context of coexisting with, and being [[suppressed]] by, an [[adultlike]] aspect of the person.
# A metaphorical child who is the [[personification]] of this part of a person.

